                                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-emerald-700" x-show="promoDiscount() > 0">Giảm <span x-text="formatMoney(promoDiscount())"></span> đ</p>
                                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500" x-show="!promoDiscount() && !selectedPromotionName">Không áp dụng khuyến mãi</p>
